		<title>AI agents take over at SETI&#039;s Allen Telescope Array, scanning for extraterrestrial intelligence</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/ai-agents-take-over-at-setis-allen-telescope-array-scanning-for-extraterrestrial-intelligence/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/ai-agents-take-over-at-setis-allen-telescope-array-scanning-for-extraterrestrial-intelligence/#respond</comments>
		
